@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="The terms that apply when candidates and employers use BothFind." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://bothfind.com/terms" />
    <title>Terms of Service | BothFind</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/public-site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/privacy.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <header class="public-header">
        <div class="public-container header-row">
            <a class="public-brand" href="/" aria-label="BothFind home">
                <span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></span>
                <span>BothFind</span>
            </a>
            <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="https://bothfind.com/privacy">Privacy</a>
            </nav>
            <div class="header-actions">
                <a class="text-button" href="/SignIn">Sign in</a>
                <a class="primary-button compact" href="/Registration">Create account</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="policy-hero public-policy-hero">
            <div class="hero-inner">
                <p class="eyebrow">CLEAR EXPECTATIONS FOR EVERYONE</p>
                <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
                <p class="hero-copy">These terms explain the rules for using BothFind as a candidate, employer or company-team member.</p>
                <p class="effective-date">Effective date: August 28, 2026</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="policy-layout terms-layout">
            <aside class="policy-nav" aria-label="Terms contents">
                <p>On this page</p>
                <a href="#acceptance">1. Acceptance</a>
                <a href="#accounts">2. Accounts</a>
                <a href="#platform">3. Platform use</a>
                <a href="#content">4. Your content</a>
                <a href="#prohibited">5. Prohibited conduct</a>
                <a href="#availability">6. Availability</a>
                <a href="#disclaimers">7. Disclaimers</a>
                <a href="#termination">8. Termination</a>
                <a href="#changes">9. Changes</a>
                <a href="#contact">10. Contact</a>
            </aside>
            <article class="policy-content">
                <section id="acceptance"><span class="section-number">01</span><h2>Acceptance of these terms</h2><p>By creating an account or using BothFind, you agree to these Terms of Service and our <a href="https://bothfind.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the service.</p></section>
                <section id="accounts"><span class="section-number">02</span><h2>Accounts and eligibility</h2><p>You must provide accurate account information, keep your credentials secure and be legally able to use employment and online account services in your location. You are responsible for activity performed through your account.</p></section>
                <section id="platform"><span class="section-number">03</span><h2>Using the platform</h2><p>BothFind provides tools for professional profiles, skills, vacancies, candidate discovery, applications and recruitment workflows. Match indicators and recommendations support decisions but do not guarantee employment, applicants or hiring outcomes.</p></section>
                <section id="content"><span class="section-number">04</span><h2>Your content</h2><p>You retain responsibility for information you submit. You grant BothFind the limited permission needed to host, process and display that information to provide the features you choose. You must have the right to submit all content and must keep it accurate.</p></section>
                <section id="prohibited"><span class="section-number">05</span><h2>Prohibited conduct</h2><p>You may not misuse the service, impersonate others, submit unlawful or deceptive content, attempt unauthorised access, interfere with security, scrape the platform without permission, distribute malware or use BothFind to discriminate unlawfully.</p></section>
                <section id="availability"><span class="section-number">06</span><h2>Service availability</h2><p>We work to keep BothFind reliable and secure, but features may change or be temporarily unavailable for maintenance, security or technical reasons. We may introduce, update or retire features as the platform develops.</p></section>
                <section id="disclaimers"><span class="section-number">07</span><h2>Important disclaimers</h2><p>BothFind is a technology platform and is not a party to employment agreements between candidates and employers. Users remain responsible for checking information, making hiring decisions and complying with applicable employment, privacy and other laws.</p></section>
                <section id="termination"><span class="section-number">08</span><h2>Suspension and termination</h2><p>You may stop using the service and request account deletion. We may restrict or terminate access when necessary to address material violations, unlawful conduct, security threats or harm to users or the platform.</p></section>
                <section id="changes"><span class="section-number">09</span><h2>Changes to these terms</h2><p>We may update these terms as BothFind evolves. We will publish the revised version here and update the effective date. Material changes may also be communicated through the service or by email where appropriate.</p></section>
                <section id="contact" class="contact-section"><span class="section-number">10</span><h2>Contact us</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to:</p><a class="contact-link" href="mailto:support@bothfind.com">support@bothfind.com</a></section>
            </article>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="public-footer compact-footer">
        <div class="public-container footer-bottom">
            <span>&copy; 2026 BothFind. All rights reserved.</span>
            <span><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="https://bothfind.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/SignIn">Sign in</a></span>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
